{
  "EpisodeId": 1040204,
  "StoryType": 1,
  "Order": 4,
  "Prev": 1040203,
  "Next": 1040205,
  "Chapter": "剧团电姬　第2章",
  "Title": "叶羽，状态绝佳",
  "EpisodeDetail": [
    {
      "Id": 1040204001,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1040204,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 1,
      "SpeakerName": "狛江地步",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "我加入奥林匹斯的时候，/n看到叶羽亲的演技，真的吓了一跳。",
      "BackgroundImageFileName": "961",
      "BgmFileName": "23",
      "VoiceFileName": "10402040010",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "511"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1040204002,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1040204,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 2,
      "SpeakerName": "狛江地步",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "明明是和我同岁的孩子，表现力却特别强。/n连很难的演技也能轻松做出来……我觉得她真的好厉害，一直很憧憬她。",
      "VoiceFileName": "10402040020",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "511"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1040204003,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1040204,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 3,
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "",
      "BackgroundImageFileName": "1580",
      "BackgroundImageFileFadeType": 4,
      "SeFileName": "1670",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "FadeValue1": 0.5,
      "FadeValue3": 0.5
    },
    {
      "Id": 1040204004,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1040204,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 4,
      "SpeakerName": "伊吕波",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "“哇啊啊啊啊啊啊啊！/n　她把你夸得超厉害啊！”",
      "VoiceFileName": "10402040030",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "401"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1040204005,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1040204,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 5,
      "SpeakerName": "卡米拉",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "“我早就觉得不得了，果然不愧是叶羽～”",
      "VoiceFileName": "10402040040",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "403"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1040204006,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1040204,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 6,
      "SpeakerName": "叶羽",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "“你们也太兴奋了。/n　万一这是先捧高再摔下来的套路怎么办。”",
      "VoiceFileName": "10402040050",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "405"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1040204007,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1040204,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 7,
      "SpeakerName": "美兔",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "“看起来……不像那样啊……”",
      "VoiceFileName": "10402040060",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "402"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1040204008,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1040204,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 8,
      "SpeakerName": "主持人",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "本巢小姐出演的剧团电姬，/n最新作《一千零一夜》也成为了热门话题。",
      "VoiceFileName": "10402040070",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "1"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1040204009,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1040204,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 9,
      "SpeakerName": "主持人",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "不过，与过去相比，本巢小姐活跃的领域有所减少，/n网络上也能看到不少粉丝对此表示遗憾。",
      "VoiceFileName": "10402040080",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "1"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1040204010,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1040204,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 10,
      "SpeakerName": "剧团电姬工作人员A",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "“＊＊＊！　拐弯抹角说什么网络啊＊＊＊＊＊！/n　这个主持人，我要把他＊＊＊以后送去＊＊＊＊！”",
      "VoiceFileName": "10402040090",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "1"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1040204011,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1040204,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 11,
      "SpeakerName": "剧团电姬工作人员B",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "“哈啊啊啊啊啊？　你绝对没看过剧团电姬的舞台吧？/n　给你把票寄过去！　事务所在哪啊！？”",
      "VoiceFileName": "10402040100",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "1"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1040204012,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1040204,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 12,
      "SpeakerName": "伊吕波",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "“哇啊啊！？　大、大家发动狂战士化了！？/n　有没有谁会用恢复魔法——！？”",
      "VoiceFileName": "10402040110",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "401"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1040204013,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1040204,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 13,
      "SpeakerName": "蕾",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "“不要慌乱！/n　这个虚构世界的统治者一定是黑暗组织一伙的！　何等卑劣！”",
      "VoiceFileName": "10402040120",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "404"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1040204014,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1040204,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 14,
      "SpeakerName": "美兔",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "“不能被愤怒吞噬……！/n　大家不要堕入黑暗啊……！”",
      "VoiceFileName": "10402040130",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "402"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1040204015,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1040204,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 15,
      "SpeakerName": "卡米拉",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "“不过这也太没良心了。我真的气炸。我的心情也一样。/n　叶羽从刚才开始就一直不说话……没事吧？　我们都站你这边。”",
      "VoiceFileName": "10402040140",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "403"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1040204016,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1040204,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 16,
      "SpeakerName": "叶羽",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "“诶？　啊——，不是挺好吗？/n　想说什么就让他们说去呗。”",
      "VoiceFileName": "10402040150",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "405"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1040204017,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1040204,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 17,
      "SpeakerName": "美兔",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "“可是――――”",
      "VoiceFileName": "10402040160",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "402"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1040204018,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1040204,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 18,
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "",
      "BackgroundImageFileName": "961",
      "BackgroundImageFileFadeType": 4,
      "BgmFileName": "999",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "FadeValue1": 0.5,
      "FadeValue3": 0.5
    },
    {
      "Id": 1040204019,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1040204,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 19,
      "SpeakerName": "狛江地步",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "的确，她除了剧团电姬的公演以外，出演机会十分有限，/n能看到她使用Sense的机会减少，我也觉得很遗憾。但是――",
      "VoiceFileName": "10402040170",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "511"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1040204020,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1040204,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 20,
      "SpeakerName": "狛江地步",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "不使用Sense的“灯神”反而广受好评。/n从我们这些童星的角度来看，这反而让人觉得非常可怕。",
      "VoiceFileName": "10402040180",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "511"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1040204021,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1040204,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 21,
      "SpeakerName": "主持人",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "这么说来……。",
      "VoiceFileName": "10402040190",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "1"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1040204022,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1040204,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 22,
      "SpeakerName": "狛江地步",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "“叶羽凭借自己的翅膀，一跃飞上了险峻的高峰。/n　可她并不满足于停留在陡峭的顶点，而是飞向了另一个巢穴……”",
      "BgmFileName": "5",
      "VoiceFileName": "10402040200",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "511"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1040204023,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1040204,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 23,
      "SpeakerName": "狛江地步",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "我记得导演老师曾这么说过。",
      "VoiceFileName": "10402040210",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "511"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1040204024,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1040204,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 24,
      "SpeakerName": "狛江地步",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "我为了登上奥林匹斯的顶峰，只能贴着地面向前爬。/n一步一步，被前辈们牵着手往上走。",
      "VoiceFileName": "10402040220",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "511"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1040204025,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1040204,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 25,
      "SpeakerName": "狛江地步",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "但现在，我也得到了大家的认可，/n甚至能让节目为我制作专题。到了现在，终于……。",
      "VoiceFileName": "10402040230",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "511"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1040204026,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1040204,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 26,
      "SpeakerName": "狛江地步",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "终于，我觉得自己已经能演出足以成为叶羽亲对手的表演了。/n我有这样的感觉。",
      "VoiceFileName": "10402040240",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "511"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1040204027,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1040204,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 27,
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "",
      "BackgroundImageFileName": "1580",
      "CharacterMotions": []
    },
    {
      "Id": 1040204028,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1040204,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 28,
      "SpeakerName": "卡米拉",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "“这孩子也太好了吧！”",
      "VoiceFileName": "10402040250",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "403"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1040204029,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1040204,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 29,
      "SpeakerName": "伊吕波",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "“她真的很懂叶羽亲呢。/n　我也觉得特别开心！”",
      "VoiceFileName": "10402040260",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "401"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1040204030,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1040204,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 30,
      "SpeakerName": "叶羽",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "“真敢说。/n　想自称我的对手，还早了100万光年！”",
      "VoiceFileName": "10402040270",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "405"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1040204031,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1040204,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 31,
      "SpeakerName": "蕾",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "“……会不会另有阴谋？　先把大众视线集中到本巢身上，再趁机控制演剧界！/n　奥林匹斯的新星，也有可能是黑暗组织的一员！”",
      "VoiceFileName": "10402040280",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "404"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1040204032,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1040204,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 32,
      "SpeakerName": "美兔",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "“我觉得……应该不是……”",
      "VoiceFileName": "10402040290",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "402"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1040204033,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1040204,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 33,
      "SpeakerName": "剧团电姬团员A",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "“快看快看，我刚发的链接！/n　已经有人整理报道了！”",
      "VoiceFileName": "10402040300",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "1"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1040204034,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1040204,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 34,
      "SpeakerName": "美兔",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "“……啊。/n　看来也不全是批评意见……太好了。”",
      "VoiceFileName": "10402040310",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "402"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1040204035,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1040204,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 35,
      "SpeakerName": "卡米拉",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "“哦，演剧区主播好像也把话题切到叶羽身上了。/n　哎呀，话题都快被你一个人包圆了。要不要我频道也来一期？”",
      "VoiceFileName": "10402040320",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "403"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1040204036,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1040204,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 36,
      "SpeakerName": "叶羽",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "“不要，麻烦死了。”",
      "VoiceFileName": "10402040330",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "405"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1040204037,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1040204,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 37,
      "SpeakerName": "叶羽",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "“嘛，过几天就会被其他话题盖过去。/n　被这些东西牵着鼻子走才亏。唉——，当红人真辛苦～。”",
      "VoiceFileName": "10402040340",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "405"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1040204038,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1040204,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 38,
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "",
      "BackgroundImageFileName": "961",
      "CharacterMotions": []
    },
    {
      "Id": 1040204039,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1040204,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 39,
      "SpeakerName": "主持人",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "――那么，本巢小姐转籍剧团电姬时，你应该很难过吧？",
      "VoiceFileName": "10402040350",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "1"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1040204040,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1040204,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 40,
      "SpeakerName": "狛江地步",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "是的……我原以为我们会一直一起站在舞台上，所以很遗憾。",
      "VoiceFileName": "10402040360",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "511"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1040204041,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1040204,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 41,
      "SpeakerName": "主持人",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "你们关系特别好吗？",
      "VoiceFileName": "10402040370",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "1"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1040204042,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1040204,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 42,
      "SpeakerName": "狛江地步",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "不是。我只是一直憧憬她，连主动搭话都做不到。/n现在回想起来，会觉得要是以前能多跟她聊聊就好了。",
      "VoiceFileName": "10402040380",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "511"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1040204043,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1040204,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 43,
      "SpeakerName": "狛江地步",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "不过，我觉得这样也好。/n因为这样，我能不是作为朋友，而是作为演员与她正面对峙。",
      "VoiceFileName": "10402040390",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "511"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1040204044,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1040204,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 44,
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "",
      "BackgroundImageFileName": "1050",
      "BackgroundImageFileFadeType": 1,
      "BgmFileName": "999",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "FadeValue1": 0.5,
      "FadeValue2": 0.30000001192092896,
      "FadeValue3": 0.5
    },
    {
      "Id": 1040204045,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1040204,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 45,
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "――某个演剧类信息交流群。",
      "BgmFileName": "23",
      "VoiceFileName": "10402040400",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "1"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1040204046,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1040204,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 46,
      "SpeakerName": "演剧类网络写手A",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "本巢叶羽！？　那孩子不是已经过气了吗？/n转籍以后我去看过几次，早就没了以前的样子！",
      "VoiceFileName": "10402040410",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "1"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1040204047,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1040204,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 47,
      "SpeakerName": "演剧类网络写手B",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "狛江地步居然把她当对手，这事没人知道吗！？/n啊，不过那孩子也是最近才刚开始受到关注。",
      "VoiceFileName": "10402040420",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "1"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1040204048,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1040204,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 48,
      "SpeakerName": "演剧类网络写手C",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "东东京的童星里，天狼星的新妻明显高出一头。/n谁会想到是本巢啊。这下必须关注了。",
      "VoiceFileName": "10402040430",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "1"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1040204049,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1040204,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 49,
      "SpeakerName": "演剧类网络写手D",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "看来你没看《一千零一夜》。/n她和当年突然出现在秋叶原时一样，是耀眼到夺目的“电姬”。",
      "VoiceFileName": "10402040440",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "1"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1040204050,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1040204,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 50,
      "SpeakerName": "演剧类网络写手们",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "诶诶！？",
      "VoiceFileName": "10402040450",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
      "SpeakerIconId": "1"
    },
    {
      "Id": 1040204051,
      "EpisodeMasterId": 1040204,
      "Order": 1,
      "GroupOrder": 51,
      "SpeakerName": "演剧类网络写手D",
      "FontSize": 2,
      "Phrase": "那么，今后的演剧界究竟会走向何方呢。",
      "VoiceFileName": "10402040460",
      "CharacterMotions": [],
